{"number":101,"arabic":"سُورَةُ القَارِعَةِ","name":"Al-Qaari'a","meaning":"The Calamity","ayahs":[{"n":1,"g":6158,"ar":"بِسْمِ ٱللَّهِ ٱلرَّحْمَٰنِ ٱلرَّحِيمِ ٱلْقَارِعَةُ","en":"The Striking Calamity -","juz":30,"page":600,"sajda":false},{"n":2,"g":6159,"ar":"مَا ٱلْقَارِعَةُ","en":"What is the Striking Calamity?","juz":30,"page":600,"sajda":false},{"n":3,"g":6160,"ar":"وَمَآ أَدْرَىٰكَ مَا ٱلْقَارِعَةُ","en":"And what can make you know what is the Striking Calamity?","juz":30,"page":600,"sajda":false},{"n":4,"g":6161,"ar":"يَوْمَ يَكُونُ ٱلنَّاسُ كَٱلْفَرَاشِ ٱلْمَبْثُوثِ","en":"It is the Day when people will be like moths, dispersed,","juz":30,"page":600,"sajda":false},{"n":5,"g":6162,"ar":"وَتَكُونُ ٱلْجِبَالُ كَٱلْعِهْنِ ٱلْمَنفُوشِ","en":"And the mountains will be like wool, fluffed up.","juz":30,"page":600,"sajda":false},{"n":6,"g":6163,"ar":"فَأَمَّا مَن ثَقُلَتْ مَوَٰزِينُهُۥ","en":"Then as for one whose scales are heavy [with good deeds],","juz":30,"page":600,"sajda":false},{"n":7,"g":6164,"ar":"فَهُوَ فِى عِيشَةٍۢ رَّاضِيَةٍۢ","en":"He will be in a pleasant life.","juz":30,"page":600,"sajda":false},{"n":8,"g":6165,"ar":"وَأَمَّا مَنْ خَفَّتْ مَوَٰزِينُهُۥ","en":"But as for one whose scales are light,","juz":30,"page":600,"sajda":false},{"n":9,"g":6166,"ar":"فَأُمُّهُۥ هَاوِيَةٌۭ","en":"His refuge will be an abyss.","juz":30,"page":600,"sajda":false},{"n":10,"g":6167,"ar":"وَمَآ أَدْرَىٰكَ مَا هِيَهْ","en":"And what can make you know what that is?","juz":30,"page":600,"sajda":false},{"n":11,"g":6168,"ar":"نَارٌ حَامِيَةٌۢ","en":"It is a Fire, intensely hot.","juz":30,"page":600,"sajda":false}],"revelation":"Meccan"}